<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
  }
  .text-right {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .text-left {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="text-left">
    <p>Internal Revenue Service</p>
    <p>District Director</p>
  </div>
  <div class="text-right">
    <p>Department of the Treasury</p>
  </div>
  <p>Date: <span data-field="date_sent">{{ date_sent }}</span></p>
  <p>
    <span data-field="salutation">{{ salutation }}</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    This modifies our letter of the above date in which we stated that you would be treated as an organization which is not a private foundation until the expiration of your advance ruling period.
  </p>
  <p>
    Based on the information you submitted, we have determined that you are not a private foundation within the meaning of section 509(a) of the Internal Revenue Code, because you are an organization of the type described in section 170(h)(1)(A)(vi). Your exempt status under section 501(c)(3) of the code is still in effect.
  </p>
  <p>
    Grantors and contributors may rely on this determination until the Internal Revenue Service publishes notice to the contrary. However, a grantor or a contributor may not rely on this determination if he or she was in part responsible for, or was aware of, the act or failure to act that resulted in your loss of section <span data-field="section_reference">{{ section_reference }}</span> status, or acquired knowledge that the Internal Revenue Service had given notice that you would be removed from classification as a section <span data-field="section_reference_2">{{ section_reference_2 }}</span> organization.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because this letter could help resolve any questions about your private foundation status, please keep it in your permanent records.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you have any questions, please contact the person whose name and telephone number are shown above.
  </p>
  <div class="text-right" style="margin-top: 100px;">
    <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
    <p style="font-size: 1.2em;">
      <span data-field="signature_placeholder">{{ signature_placeholder }}</span>
    </p>
    <p>Exempt Organization Specialist</p>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 100px;">
    P. O. Box <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>, <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>, <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> <span data-field="zip_code_2">{{ zip_code_2 }}</span>
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="text-left">
    <p>Secretary of State</p>
    <p>Corporations Division</p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address_2">{{ street_address_2 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>, <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="text-left" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>OLIVER &amp; WINKLE, P.C.</p>
    <p><span data-field="name_1">{{ name_1 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>, <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="center">
    <h2>CERTIFICATE OF NAME CHANGE AMENDMENT</h2>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    I, <span data-field="officer_name">{{ officer_name }}</span>, the Secretary of State and the Corporations Commissioner of the State of Georgia, do hereby certify under the seal of my office that
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    THE CLAYTON COLLEGE &amp; STATE UNIVERSITY FOUNDATION, INC.
    <br>
    A DOMESTIC NONPROFIT CORPORATION
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    has filed articles of amendment in the Office of the Secretary of State changing its name to
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-weight: bold;">
    CLAYTON STATE UNIVERSITY FOUNDATION, INC.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    and has paid the required fees as provided by Title 14 of the Official Code of Georgia Annotated. Attached hereto is a true and correct copy of said articles of amendment.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 50px;">
    WITNESS my hand and official seal in the City of <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span> and the State of Georgia on the date set forth above.
  </p>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 100px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <img src="placeholder_seal.png" alt="Seal" style="max-width: 150px; height: auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <p>
        <span data-field="signature_placeholder">{{ signature_placeholder }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span data-field="secretary_name">{{ secretary_name }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>Secretary of State</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="text-left">
    <p>Secretary of State</p>
    <p>Corporations Division</p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address_2">{{ street_address_2 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>, <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="text-left" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>CLAYTON COLLEGE &amp; STATE UNIVERSITY</p>
    <p><span data-field="name_1">{{ name_1 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>, <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="center">
    <h2>CERTIFICATE OF NAME CHANGE AMENDMENT</h2>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    I, <span data-field="officer_name">{{ officer_name }}</span>, the Secretary of State and the Corporation Commissioner of the State of Georgia, do hereby certify under the seal of my office that
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    THE CLAYTON STATE COLLEGE FOUNDATION, INC.
    <br>
    A DOMESTIC NONPROFIT CORPORATION
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    has filed articles of amendment in the office of the Secretary of State changing its name to
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-weight: bold;">
    THE CLAYTON COLLEGE &amp; UNIVERSITY FOUNDATION, INC.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    and has paid the required fees as provided by Title 14 of the Official Code of Georgia Annotated. Attached hereto is a true and correct copy of said articles of amendment.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 50px;">
    WITNESS my hand and official seal in the City of <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span> and the State of Georgia on the date set forth above.
  </p>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 100px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <img src="placeholder_seal.png" alt="Seal" style="max-width: 150px; height: auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <p>
        <span data-field="signature_placeholder">{{ signature_placeholder }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span data-field="secretary_name">{{ secretary_name }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>Secretary of State</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="center">
    <h2>AMENDMENT</h2>
    <p>to the</p>
    <h2>ARTICLES OF INCORPORATION</h2>
    <p>of</p>
    <h2>THE CLAYTON STATE COLLEGE FOUNDATION, INC.</h2>
    <p>incorporated in <span data-field="incorporation_year">{{ incorporation_year }}</span> as The Clayton Junior College Foundation, Inc.</p>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    The undersigned officers of the Corporation, acting pursuant to the authority of the Corporation by duly held and constituted meeting of the Board of Trustees of the Corporation, subsequently ratified and approved expressly by all Trustees of the Corporation, do hereby adopt the following Articles of Amendment to the Articles of Incorporation for such Corporation.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    1. The present name of the Corporation is <span data-field="current_name">{{ current_name }}</span>.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    2. The amendment to the Articles of Incorporation of the Corporation which was adopted is as follows:
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    RESOLVED: That the officers of the Corporation be, and they are hereby authorized and directed to take all necessary action to amend the Articles of Incorporation of the Corporation to change the name of the Corporation to <span data-field="new_name">{{ new_name }}</span>, including publication of a notice of corporate name change in the legal organ of Clayton County once a week for two (2) consecutive weeks.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    3. The date of the adoption of the amendment by the Board of Trustees was September 19, 2005. The meeting was called by writing notice more than fifteen (15) days prior thereto, and
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 50px;">
    THE CLAYTON STATE COLLEGE FOUNDATION, INC.
  </p>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 100px;">
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: left;">
      By:
      <p style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <span data-field="signature_placeholder">{{ signature_placeholder }}</span>
      </p>
      <p>Harmon M. Born, Chairman</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      (CORPORATE SEAL)
    </div>
  </div>
</div>